<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank ups warrants on CITIC Pacific.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank ups warrants on CITIC Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said on Thursday it intended to issue a further 60 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd inaddition to its 118 million existing warrants.</p>
<p>The new warrants will be priced at HK$0.73, the existing warrants' closing price on Thursday, and have a premium of 7.3 percent and gearing of 6.2 times.</p>
<p>Both the new and existing warrants have a strike price of HK$41.10 and expire on September 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>CITIC Pacific shares ended at HK$45.10 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
